-- Goal: Reach the remains of the roadway to Tharbad (Distance: 2569)
UPDATE goals SET description = 'The returning company traces the route of the Old South Road, which has decayed from a royal highway into a mere track through the wilderness. As the travellers cross the wet flats north of the Gap of Rohan, they find only the crumbling remains of causeways and long green embankments to mark the ancient engineering. They ride steadily towards the crossing at Tharbad, with the Misty Mountains rising to the east and the empty lands of Eregion awaiting them. Though the stones are gone, the shadow of the road still leads them away from Isengard and back towards the sanctuary of Rivendell.' WHERE distance = 2569 * 1.60934;

-- Goal: Stop at a small stream (Distance: 2599)
UPDATE goals SET description = 'The company travels northward through the quiet lands between the Misty Mountains and the expanse of the Enedwaith, finding the ancient stones of the roadway mostly hidden by long grass. Beside a small, clear stream that cuts across their path, the travellers halt to water their ponies and prepare a midday meal under the open grey sky. Frodo and his companions enjoy the peaceful stillness of the wild country, a stark contrast to the dark tumult of the war they have left behind. Although the road is lonely, the Fellowship finds comfort in the familiar routines of travel as they draw closer to the borders of Eregion.' WHERE distance = 2599 * 1.60934;

