UPDATE goals SET description = 'The travellers identify the hillock crowned with a circle of stones where the Fellowship was once besieged by Wargs. Scorch marks still stain the rocks from the magical fire Gandalf wielded to drive back the wolves during that terrifying night. Standing in the quiet daylight, the hobbits marvel at the blackened evidence of their past struggles, measuring how far they have come since that winter evening. They leave the silent hill behind, riding through Eregion with hearts lighter than on their outward quest.' WHERE distance = 2874 * 1.60934;

-- Goal: Open country. Gentle slopes, easier for the ponies (Distance: 2909)
UPDATE goals SET description = 'The company traverses the open country of Hollin, finding the gentle slopes far easier for the ponies than during the dark days of the quest. Frodo and his friends ride without fear of the wargs that once besieged the Fellowship upon the nearby hill, for the land is now silent and peaceful under the sun. The travellers retrace their path through the ancient realm of Eregion, making good speed northwards towards the hidden sanctuary of Rivendell. Galadriel and Celeborn ride with the hobbits, their bright presence banishing the shadows that once haunted this rugged wilderness.' WHERE distance = 2909 * 1.60934;

