UPDATE goals SET description = 'The travellers establish their camp atop a prominent ridge in Hollin, sheltered by a cluster of large, smooth rocks that tower against the starry sky. Frodo and his companions find the silence of Eregion peaceful now, a stark contrast to the dread they felt years ago when fleeing towards the mountains. The ponies graze contentedly around the base of the stone pillars while Gandalf sits in quiet contemplation of the road behind them. With the Shadow defeated, the empty lands hold no terror, allowing the company to rest deeply before the final leg of their journey to Rivendell.' WHERE distance = 2959 * 1.60934;

