UPDATE goals SET description = 'The returning company treks along the highlands where the ground falls away sharply to the west, revealing the Loudwater flowing in a deep, carved valley. This swift river, the Bruinen, rushes through the ravine towards the Ford, marking the final barrier before the sanctuary of Rivendell. Frodo and his companions look down upon the grey waters that once rose to defend them against the Ringwraiths, though now the stream runs clear and peaceful. The sight of the deep valley brings hope to the weary hobbits, for they know the Hidden Valley lies just beyond the river''s edge.' WHERE distance = 3071 * 1.60934;

